usage: collect.py [-h] {write-spec,collect} ...

Collect fixed stress raw streams before the real core dataset is available.
Operational glue only. Existing workers, numerical settings, scale adapter,
source binder and final readers remain unchanged. No core identity is
invented.

positional arguments:
  {write-spec,collect}
    write-spec          Bind completed early assets only; never evaluate
    collect             Requires the later explicit serialized engine handoff

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
